CREATED:20261001T184406Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T184406Z
UID:42921-1794749400-1794753000@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:Fabulous Ferns
DESCRIPTION:Fascinating facts about ferns! To know them is to love them. Learn about their ancient pedigree and how they reproduce. Get to know fern structure – how to find the fertile fronds. Where do they grow\, you ask? Forests\, bogs\, fields\, rock faces… and shade borders! Advice on where and when to plant them\, maintaining and dividing them\, and dealing with pests and problems. Learn how to enhance your garden with over 18 individual ferns including pictures and growing information. \nHosted by the Greater Toronto Bulb Society.  All welcome
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/fabulous-ferns-5/
LOCATION:Toronto Botanical Garden\, 777 Lawrence Avenue East\, Toronto\, ON\, M3C 1P2\, Canada
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Toronto Master Gardeners
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T190000
DTSTAMP:20261021T195328Z
CREATED:20261021T195328Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T195328Z
UID:43015-1794852000-1794855600@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:Garden with Purpose: Practical Ecological Gardening\, Mount Pleasant Library
DESCRIPTION:You have the power to create real ecological change — right in your own backyard. In this introductory program\, discover the core principles of ecological gardening and learn how to transform your garden into a space that’s both environmentally responsible and visually stunning. A Toronto Master Gardener will provide guidance on how to create habitat\, manage water wisely\, and reduce your ecological impact — all while cultivating a landscape rich with beauty and year-round interest. Suitable for gardeners of any skill level\, with any kind of outdoor space.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/garden-with-purpose-practical-ecological-gardening-mount-pleasant-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public Library – Mount Pleasant\, 599 Mount Pleasant Road\, Toronto\, ON\, M4S 2M5\, Canada
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Toronto Master Gardeners
