LAST-MODIFIED:20261021T204123Z
UID:43038-1794938400-1794942000@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:The Orchid: Daunting Diva\, Evocative Evolutionary or Humble Houseplant? Taylor Memorial Library
DESCRIPTION:The Orchid is now the world’s MOST popular houseplant. Facilitated by a Toronto Master Gardener\, learn fascinating stories\, fun facts and tips on orchid care. Love them already but yours don’t bloom? Don’t fret! We have answers. Have disease and pest problems? We help you solve them. Plus\, the best orchids to grow in your home. Suitable for gardeners of any skill level.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/the-orchid-daunting-diva-evocative-evolutionary-or-humble-houseplant-taylor-memorial-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public Library – Taylor Memorial branch\, 1440 Kingston Rd.\, Scarborough
END:VEVENT
