SUMMARY:Planting Bulbs in the Fall\, Morningside Library
DESCRIPTION:Planting bulbs in the fall will bring glorious rewards in your spring garden. A Toronto Master Gardener will give advice on what to plant\, how to plant them and yes\, even a few pointers on squirrels! At the end of the program\, bulbs will be given out to attendees\, while supplies last.\nSuitable for gardeners of any skill level\, with any kind of outdoor space.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/planting-bulbs-in-the-fall-morningside-library/
LOCATION:Toronto Public Library – Morningside\, 4279 Lawrence Ave E\, Scarborough\, Ontario\, M1E 2S8\, Canada
END:VEVENT
